+	(1.8 to 4.8), head top 6.6 under the canopy top 7.1 (a 0.5-stud taller avatar: 6.96), arms inside the 4.2-wide
+	canopy. The cockpit is over the kit's nose so the pivot is 43 % back from the nose tip. Wings / tailplanes are
+	WedgeParts laid flat (Rot 0, 0, 90): a delta with a swept leading edge. The gear is drawn where the jet stands
+	(the kit's hidden gear carries it). Bombs hang under the wings; the bomb release point is on the belly. ]]
